From 8ee243bb2ba5662c532f39412ec2910d970df831 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:38:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Gate idle local supervisor drains while retaining
 external polling

Proof: supervisor gate RED idle drains 4 vs 1; GREEN 10 gate tests and 31 existing supervisor cases. Real killed holder and due-expiry regressions kill active-poll suppression; terminal-request-only update kills missing request input. Unstubbed synthetic drain replay preserves executor refresh (48 vs 240 upserts). Empty-board CPU is not improved (0.48 vs 0.36ms); realistic hub replay and live budget proof remain required before shipping.
